# Schneider transfer summary

Merge these three files into the remote project under applications/logai/:

- values.yaml — add recovery settings, disabled by default.
- values-eu-west-3-eks-shared-dev.yaml — enable recovery for UAT.
- templates/20-logai-api.yaml — add recovery environment variables and the
  read-only database password Secret mount.

Chart.yaml and templates/_helpers.tpl need no changes.
No apps.yaml is required in this chart.

Before deployment, publish the new API image and update its tag and digest.
Schneider must confirm the Secret password is synchronized.

Helm validation and 63 API tests passed, including preservation of active
transactions during password rotation.
